{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：16:08 2026-11-22 HKT</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e5781330aa6cfca6c94e35476c58f59d/2026-11/FotoJet_17.jpg\"/>\n<p>一輛寶馬私家車於今日（22日）下午在尖沙咀寶勒巷失控剷上行人路，撞倒多名途人並撼向地舖，釀成1死3傷車禍。目擊者張太講述車禍經過，指她當時在餐廳內用餐，突然聽到「嘭」一聲巨響，「好似爆炸咁，覺得好驚」。她於是走出餐廳查看，即見寶馬私家車已將泊於街邊的一列單車全部掃毀「甩晒轆」，「有4個行人俾佢（寶馬）掃低埋，見到2個（行人）都幾嚴重」，</p>\n<p>相關新聞︰寶馬瘋狂駕駛大鬧尖沙咀 失控剷上行人路再撞地舖 釀一死三傷</p>\n<img alt=\"目擊者張太講述意外發生經過。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/787ac57e14b7fc3a32ad9b3125c19e2e/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-22_at_15_34_16.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7819400b23676c92dae1d39f707d9e51/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-22_at_15_42_41.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ac1009eed6b4fac0ea7da9ea26db8bb7/2026-11/03_1_40.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a864cd0f663d4bc8f764aa1156c8dab9/2026-11/04_3_29.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/32aab4f42ac30d3c76e24a2acb3ea867/2026-11/05_1_27.jpg\"/>\n<p>張太稱，全部被撞途人倒臥行人路上，事發後約10分鐘消防車趕到現場，大批途人圍觀。她亦目擊寶馬車上有「一男一女落車走」，一名途人協助追截，但兩名男女往漆咸道方向逃去。她指自己首次在現場目暏交通意外發生，自己「都覺得驚」，稍後才平復心情。</p>\n<p>相關新聞︰尖沙咀奪命車禍｜網傳影片曝男司機女乘客棄車離開 途人追截怒轟：唔好走呀！</p>\n<img alt=\"fb馬路的事討論區圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/25ead751d71ecab71c5d188003b3793a/2026-11/3_73.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"fb馬路的事討論區圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a12f05fddd751020bf909a0dd2abe480/2026-11/4_5_61.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dc68f813244c86f0e7a636ad0b2340a7/2026-11/5_0_61.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4c8e3fe6915911e643ba2e40bc1542e0/2026-11/6_2_24.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場一片凌亂。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c18c3769ad253f8810e0086e4d876376/2026-11/01_1_39.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b24f8f6b9030b3fdb48837f02573a359/2026-11/02_46.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T08:23:45.842243+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":390,"images":12,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T08:08:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T08:17:21.929213+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T08:17:21.929213+00:00","content_hash":"0f7d29ba124150a0bf72703a6213336464631d8f8817259090bf7f053bab8277","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}